272	    /**
273	     * The starting calendar year of the fiscal year that contains the given date. The fiscal year
274	     * starts on 1 July, so a date in July or later belongs to the fiscal year starting that same
275	     * calendar year, while a date from January to June belongs to the fiscal year that started in
276	     * the previous calendar year.
